///     PhysicalStorageBuffer>, Generic> { spirv.decoration =
///     #spirv.decoration<AliasedPointer> }) -> () "None" { ... }
///
/// spirv.func @restrict_pointee(%arg0: !spirv.ptr<!spirv.ptr<i32,
